# __SLUG__

`pswamp-__SLUG__`, package `pswamp_modules.__PKG__`, class `__NAME__Module`,
entry point `__SLUG__` (group `pswamp.modules`).

The __LABEL__ module. For each frame it reports the station with the highest
frequency, and that frequency.

| | Message | Defined in |
|---|---|---|
| Reads | `PmuFrame` | `pswamp_models.pmu` |
| Emits | `__NAME__Result` (body `__NAME__Body`) | `pswamp_models.__PKG__` |
| Accepts | no command | |

**Parameters:** none. A frame with no frequency value publishes nothing.

